+```text
+(empty)
+(literal CP)             (literal byte B)
+(class LO-HI ...)        (class byte LO-HI ...)
+(concat NODE ...)        (alternate NODE ...)
+(repeat MIN MAX NODE)    (repeat lazy MIN MAX NODE)      MAX is - when unbounded
+(group K NODE)           (group K NAME NODE)
